<title>SINGAPORE: TABLE-Republic Hotels six-mth net falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Republic Hotels six-mth net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			 6.97    vs     10.13</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)	    2.44    vs	3.54</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct)		   2.0     vs	2.0</p>
<p>    Turnover			  77.47    vs     68.55</p>
<p>    Investment income		0.11    vs	0.08</p>
<p>    Other income		     1.07    vs	1.52</p>
<p>    Interest expense		 3.10    vs	1.55</p>
<p>    Depreciation/amortisation   11.31    vs	8.62</p>
<p>    Operating profit		10.71    vs     14.71</p>
<p>    Associates			 1.08    vs	nil</p>
<p>    Tax				  5.36    vs	4.58</p>
<p>    Minorities			 0.55    vs	nil</p>
<p>Note- Full name is Republic Hotels and Resorts Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3080)</p>
</text>
